---
#### What group_vars/all/secrets.sops.yaml holds before sops encrypts it: the
#### secrets Ansible itself needs, which are the ones provision.yml uses on the
#### Proxmox hosts. A NixOS host's secrets are in secrets/fleet.yaml instead.
#### This file is only an example, and Ansible does not load it. Make the real
#### one with `sops group_vars/all/secrets.sops.yaml`, which opens an editor
#### and encrypts on save. Never commit it unencrypted.

# The password provision.yml sets for root and the admin account. Empty leaves
# every password as it is.
server_password: ""
